title: "Dental Appointment No-show Prediction"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Asgari"
    given-names: "Hamed"
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/hamed-asgari/dental-appointment-no-show-prediction
url: >-
  https://github.com/hamed-asgari/dental-appointment-no-show-prediction
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, leakage-controlled machine-learning study of dental
  appointment no-show prediction using fully synthetic data, chronological
  validation, probability calibration, operational sensitivity analysis, and
  a pre-registered one-time test probability audit.
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - no-show prediction
  - synthetic data
  - temporal validation
  - probability calibration
